          "title": "Stampit Club - Rewards and loyalty system for small businesses",
          "subtitle": "Jan 2025 - Jan 2025",
          "subComponenets": [
            {
              "description": [
                {
                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "That's my side project which I started \"vibe coding\", and then reached a solid phase where I decided to spend a bit more time to polish and it's now ready to be used! React Native mobile app + Ruby on Rails powered backend.\n\nBig brands have their own platforms—why shouldn’t your favorite café, salon, or barbershop? Paper loyalty cards get lost or forgotten, but our digital solution makes earning and redeeming rewards effortless.\n\nWith Stampit Club, small businesses can easily manage loyalty programs, engage customers, and handle bookings—all in one place, without the high costs or complexity of big-name solutions.\n\nIt’s time to give local businesses the same tools to build loyalty. What do you think—are paper loyalty cards a thing of the past?"
                }
              ]
            }
